But `Arc<dyn ContentProvider>` in a thread_local with `const` init — `const { RefCell::new(None) }` works for Option<Arc<dyn Trait>>? Arc<dyn Trait> is not const-constructible but None is. `RefCell::new(None::<Arc<dyn ContentProvider>>)` — const OK.

