Fix: make a helper `push_unique_in(row, key, value)`:
```rust
fn push_unique_in(row: &mut Row, key: &str, value: Value) {
    let list = row.get_mut(key).and_then(Value::as_array_mut);
    if let Some(list) = list {
        if !list.contains(&value) { list.push(value); }
    }
}
```
And calls: push_unique_in(row, "trainerIds", json!(tid)); push_unique_in(row, "skillType", json!(label)); etc. This mutates in place — proper semantics. Let me replace vec_get_mut/push_unique usage.

